descriptionByLocale.en:
As head of the "Insertion" workshop in the Orbe Plains Establishments (EPO), you will ensure that prisoners who may suffer from psychiatric disorders are treated individually, with the aim of rehabilitating them in the best possible conditions. You guarantee a safe and structured environment for detainees, ensuring their physical, moral and emotional integrity. You act at all times in accordance with our values: "Loyality, Solidarity, Credibility".

• Ensure individualized care of detained persons and make special arrangements with a view to the best possible development and reintegration;
• Ensure supervision, security and supervision of prisoners working in the workshop and ensure that discipline is maintained;
• Provide day-to-day supervision for people who may suffer from psychiatric disorders. For further information, please consult the specifications by clicking here or contact Mr Christophe Progin, manager of the workshops, at 024 557 70 55.

• Holder of an CFC or equivalent title;
• Holder of the Federal Certificate of Custody Officer or undertake to obtain him in employment;
• Good mental and physical skills to manage sometimes difficult situations or conflicts while keeping a distance suitable for your function;
• Good ability to manage teams;
• Mastery of French and common computer tools. Our terms and conditions of employment require you to be a Swiss citizen or holder of a licence C, free of a deed of default of property (an extract from the Office of Prosecutions must be presented during the process), and your criminal record must be blank. There is a right to consult the criminal record under the Federal Criminal Records Act by the engagement authority for this function.

Position in the Cantonal Administration of Vaud (State of Vaud), Switzerland. Online application on the official career portal offers-emploi.vd.ch.

